    keyTakeaways: ["PoS transacción data provides empirical evidence for minorista zoning decisions that historically relied on traffic counts and qualitative assessments.", "Spatial clustering of PoS data reveals natural commercial catchment areas that may differ substantially from administrative zoning boundaries.", "Integrating PoS análisis into urban planning processes can optimize minorista density, reduce commercial vacancies, and improve pedestrian accessibility."],
