        q: "How accurately can PoS data predict seasonal personaling needs?",
        a: "PoS-based predicción models can typically predict daily transacción volumes within ten to fifteen percent of actual values when trained on two or more years of historical data. This precision is sufficient for advance scheduling decisions, though short-term adjustments may still be necessary for unexpected demand shocks such as weather events or viral social media activity.",
